      "content": "This is a good start, but it's a bit too generic. For the training to be effective, officers need to be able to recognize these patterns in specific contexts. For example, when we're talking about \"group dynamics\" or \"unusual clothing\" in these high-density areas, can you get more specific? What kind of specific aesthetics, styles of dress, or types of group interactions are most statistically correlated with gang presence or street-level crime in these types of neighborhoods? We want to give them concrete visual cues to look for.",
